==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~6 seconds<sup>2f~180f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
**Infinite [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
**2 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.13 seconds<sup>2f~4f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Stall with [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]], and max wallet and worker cat. When THE SLOTH comes out, spam everything. Ranged units are helpful here. Also use a few [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]] if you have any. The [[Battle Items#Cat CPU|Cat CPU]] is recommended in case you can't spam everything in time when THE SLOTH appears. In 4 Crowns you can use [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Cleanerbot]] to stall at the beginning to earn yourself more money, he can also survive a hit from THE SLOTH.

